# Kiro のワークスペース設定。BLEA など AWS のプロジェクトの慣行に合わせ、公開しない。
# 知識の本体は追跡対象（docs/ 配下）に置き、.kiro/ には「いつ読むか」だけを持たせる。
.kiro/

# 非公開の作業メモ・レビュー来歴・MCP のメモリ
.private/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# SAM / CDK
.aws-sam/
cdk.out/
samconfig.toml

# Terraform
# .terraform/ holds the downloaded provider binary (26 MB for one provider).
# State is excluded because Terraform writes variable values into it in clear text, including any
# marked sensitive — the cache cluster password would be committed in readable form.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT excluded: it pins provider hashes and is the Terraform
# equivalent of the exact pins in requirements-dev.txt.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Node
node_modules/

# ローカル生成物
bandit-report.json
tmp-previews/
.DS_Store
